+`default.integrity=repair` requires `default.allowStoreUpdate=true`. `fail` validates the
+index and its folder without changing them; `ignore` does not inspect their integrity.
+
 This can help in CI environments to prevent misconfiguration:
 For example, a CI build should probably never create a new the violation store, but operate on
 an existing one.
